kind: TaskDialog
modelDescription: |-
  Records a possible duplicate pair for human review. Requires exact DiscoveryRunID, two different saved CandidateIDs, and an evidence-based DuplicateRationale. Both candidates must be linked to the run through observations or LINKED extracted leads.

  Saves the pair as UNREVIEWED. Input order does not matter; an existing pair blocks another record. Does not confirm duplicate identity, merge or change candidates, execute searches, or approve any gate.

  Use only when asked to record a suspected duplicate. Never invent IDs or present the rationale as verified fact. Report success only for POSSIBLE_DUPLICATE_PAIR_SAVED. For duplicate, blocked, or uncertain outcomes, report the result without automatic retry.
outputs:
  - propertyName: duplicatepairresult

action:
  kind: InvokeFlowTaskAction
  flowId: c6049105-71d3-f111-a05b-002248d5b537
  connectionProperties:
    $kind: ConnectionProperties
    diagnostics:
    mode: Invoker

outputMode: All